{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gunman Drift is an immersive experience where the player must focus on drifting and shooting at the same time. In this game, the player can customise their weapon and car of choice, and the paint of the car. There are some obstacles and opportunities for the player to score some points and in turn level up. Everything the player does results in experience, and experience rewards the player with money and crates. As the player makes progress, they gain enough money to unlock faster cars and better weapons. This game has been developed in such a way that players can enjoy the same experience both on a computer and in virtual reality.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621150?t=1744273618","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621150?t=1744273618","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621150/a0ad67ea642c709edd983e1bb6584bced7f8b7e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744273618","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621150/a0ad67ea642c709edd983e1bb6584bced7f8b7e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744273618","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gunman Drift is an immersive experience where the player must focus on drifting and shooting at the same time. In this game, the player can customise their weapon and car of choice, and the paint of the car. There are some obstacles and opportunities for the player to score some points and in turn level up. Everything the player does results in experience, and experience rewards the player with money and crates. As the player makes progress, they gain enough money to unlock faster cars and better weapons. This game has been developed in such a way that players can en